OL,3,GNEWSABrace yourself for winter floods,
OL,4,Acouncil warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople in Leicestershire have been
OL,7,Fwarned of the likelihood of flooding
OL,8,Fthis winter and the need to be prepared
OL,9,Ffor it.
OL,11,FAdam Tilbury, cabinet member for
OL,12,Fflooding at Leicestershire County
OL,13,FCouncil, said it was "not a case of if
OL,14,Fbut when flooding will happen in some
OL,15,Fareas of the county".
OL,17,FAt-risk areas including Bottesford,
OL,18,FEast Goscote and Newtown Linford have
OL,19,Freceived flood defence items as part of
OL,20,Fa #400,000 community grant scheme which
OL,21,Fopened for applications in January
OL,22,F2026.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
